{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16835","headline":"步虚词十九首 十六 · 韦渠牟","name":"步虚词十九首 十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉树襍金花，天河织女家。\n月邀丹凤舃，风送紫鸾车。\n雾縠笼绡带，云屏列锦霞。\n瑶台千万里，不觉往来赊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦渠牟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16835.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16835","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}